Subject: [PATCH] Contract/Basic: Segment.iterate_seq, segments composed along
 a sequence; Round.iterate_seq from it

A sequence of segments with arbitrary starts (cs r to cs (r + 1), each over the
same forbidden set and head relation) composes into one segment over the
summed time. Round.iterate_seq is its corollary through Round.segment. G5's
controller chains one segment per simulated step from a different control
state each time, which Round.iterate_seq (one anchor) does not cover.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
